{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lessaria is the spiritual successor to Majesty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/ad04bb41b5cefc00c7ad10e452c694c2.poster.avif?t=1764066584\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/ad04bb41b5cefc00c7ad10e452c694c2.webm?t=1764066584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're bringing back the RTS genre with indirect control. You build a kingdom, hire heroes, and they live their own lives, doing whatever they please. Try winning a battle with such an unpredictable army! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New ideas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/cba56e9cc0f4a06a90a5ebf57d60220c.poster.avif?t=1764066584\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/cba56e9cc0f4a06a90a5ebf57d60220c.webm?t=1764066584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're not creating a clone \u2014 we're evolving the game as if we're making the third part of the series. Brand-new combat system. Hero squads. We're adding many fresh ideas to the genre.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/6f6deda041830f08ee294ed4f0953bc5.poster.avif?t=1764066584\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/6f6deda041830f08ee294ed4f0953bc5.webm?t=1764066584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you've never played Majesty, you'll love how captivating the gameplay is! You'll be watching this world come to life, and it's hard not to get drawn in. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-development with players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/43a901f8b0abf7c3d3578044084ab190.poster.avif?t=1764066584\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/43a901f8b0abf7c3d3578044084ab190.webm?t=1764066584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We regularly conduct playtests, gather feedback, and implement exciting ideas. This makes the game even more engaging and full of interesting features.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Warming Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2461280/63c3908a241b7e47c4786029ac2d89860f6a3a8d.jpg"},{"name":"Still Standing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2461280/3d1d8143bb16cecac3433fde3307e6547ad7a568.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2461280/5d815e193e387c1a81f1b78102cad2b87c8efb0d.jpg"},{"name":"Jack of All Trades","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2461280/85926bd6c53cd9b65451558785ecef0383d815f7.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Overlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2461280/9f7e497006cdfdd56100c8478d0315156ab6226e.jpg"},{"name":"Defender of Lessaria","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2461280/84c33bb1dae4d41e88e577d179d96d3a729f1a35.jpg"},{"name":"Warlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2461280/8c630703da8cafc34330d361f92cd3ab1cfe0260.jpg"},{"name":"General","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2461280/0322f804f590aa870ccef2aae0b3e2f31b070a5d.jpg"},{"name":"Marshal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2461280/8b74516ba7a3cfdd26ee035b4e830bfaadbab73d.jpg"},{"name":"Defender of the Weak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2461280/4f0f9ad12c18f2e79e70dbbf991c313408b2e9e8.jpg"}],"total":53},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2461280?t=1764066584","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/1d8887d36e3649b2cad5a04556e99cbe3b9d25e3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764066584","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/7e31da85a7f1d27de2d3c59c8462c75c84a082e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764066584","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/7e31da85a7f1d27de2d3c59c8462c75c84a082e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764066584","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lessaria is the spiritual successor to Majesty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/ad04bb41b5cefc00c7ad10e452c694c2.poster.avif?t=1764066584\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/ad04bb41b5cefc00c7ad10e452c694c2.webm?t=1764066584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're bringing back the RTS genre with indirect control. You build a kingdom, hire heroes, and they live their own lives, doing whatever they please. Try winning a battle with such an unpredictable army! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New ideas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/cba56e9cc0f4a06a90a5ebf57d60220c.poster.avif?t=1764066584\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/cba56e9cc0f4a06a90a5ebf57d60220c.webm?t=1764066584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're not creating a clone \u2014 we're evolving the game as if we're making the third part of the series. Brand-new combat system. Hero squads. We're adding many fresh ideas to the genre.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/6f6deda041830f08ee294ed4f0953bc5.poster.avif?t=1764066584\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/6f6deda041830f08ee294ed4f0953bc5.webm?t=1764066584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you've never played Majesty, you'll love how captivating the gameplay is! You'll be watching this world come to life, and it's hard not to get drawn in. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-development with players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/43a901f8b0abf7c3d3578044084ab190.poster.avif?t=1764066584\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/43a901f8b0abf7c3d3578044084ab190.webm?t=1764066584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We regularly conduct playtests, gather feedback, and implement exciting ideas. This makes the game even more engaging and full of interesting features.</p>","developers":["Rockbee Team"],"dlc":[4075280],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/f342966fff3d1a892a020c9ebfd2e96433947f74/header.jpg?t=1764066584","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":73,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/lessaria-fantasy-kingdom-sim?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2461280/1065387797/48f4156e61940e9b0aaaa50457dd73ba32b57c31/1760953814/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760966570","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile